2a:["$","section",null,{"className":"mt-6 rounded-md border border-border bg-bg-panel p-8","children":[["$","h2",null,{"className":"mb-4 text-2xl font-bold text-fg","children":"Vague Transformation Language Is Costing You Qualified Leads"}],["$","p",null,{"className":"mb-4 leading-relaxed text-fg-muted","children":"Phrases like \"unlock your potential,\" \"create aligned success,\" or \"live with intention\" don't convert because they don't describe a result anyone can picture. Your ideal client has a specific, urgent problem. Name it specifically."}],["$","p",null,{"className":"mb-4 leading-relaxed text-fg-muted","children":"The test: can a stranger read your hero headline and tell you - in one sentence - what they will have or be able to do after working with you? If the answer requires interpretation, the headline is the leak."}],["$","p",null,{"className":"leading-relaxed text-fg-muted","children":["Compare: ",["$","span",null,{"className":"font-semibold text-fg","children":"\"I help coaches build sustainable businesses\""}]," vs ",["$","span",null,{"className":"font-semibold text-fg","children":"\"I help 1:1 coaches go from 2 clients/month to a waitlist in 60 days - without paid ads.\""}]," The second one self-selects the right person and filters out everyone else. That's the goal."]}]]}]
2b:["$","section",null,{"className":"mt-6 rounded-md border border-border bg-bg-panel p-8","children":[["$","h2",null,{"className":"mb-4 text-2xl font-bold text-fg","children":"Testimonials Without Specifics Are Almost Worthless"}],["$","p",null,{"className":"mb-4 leading-relaxed text-fg-muted","children":"For personal services - coaching, consulting, advisory - social proof is load-bearing. Visitors need to believe before they'll book. But most testimonials are vague: \"Working with [Name] changed my life.\" That's not proof. That's noise."}],["$","p",null,{"className":"mb-4 leading-relaxed text-fg-muted","children":["Specific testimonials convert. The format: ",["$","span",null,{"className":"font-semibold text-fg","children":"who they were before → what specifically changed → the measurable result → the timeframe."}]," \"I'd been stuck at $4k months for a year. Three months in, I hit $11k and hired my first assistant.\" That's a proof asset. Collect it, feature it prominently, and put it above the CTA - not buried in a carousel at the bottom."]}],["$","p",null,{"className":"leading-relaxed text-fg-muted","children":"If you don't have strong testimonials yet, use case outcomes with permission: \"Client A went from 2 to 9 clients in 6 weeks.\" Named or anonymous, the specifics are what carry the weight."}]]}]
2c:["$","section",null,{"className":"mt-6 rounded-md border border-border bg-bg-panel p-8","children":[["$","h2",null,{"className":"mb-4 text-2xl font-bold text-fg","children":"Not Showing Pricing Forces An Awkward Conversation"}],["$","p",null,{"className":"mb-4 leading-relaxed text-fg-muted","children":"Hiding pricing to \"encourage a discovery call\" is a mistake for most coaches and consultants. Visitors who can't afford you will book the call anyway, waste both your time, and leave frustrated. Visitors who can afford you but are unsure of the value will ghost because there's no way to self-qualify."}],["$","p",null,{"className":"leading-relaxed text-fg-muted","children":"You don't need to show exact pricing. But showing a range (\"Investment starts at $X/month\"), a starting point, or a clear anchor (\"3-month engagement\") gives qualified visitors something to calibrate against - and filters out those who were never a fit. Every minute you spend on an unqualified discovery call is a minute not spent on the page that generated it."}]]}]
